      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793114692437,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Now we have cov(x1,x2) Matrix\nfor each PA1 But how to\ncalulate for each data point ? \n\nWithout Changing the direction ",
      "fontSize": 57.6148186736118,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Now we have cov(x1,x2) Matrix for each PA1 But how to calulate for each data point ? \n\nWithout Changing the direction ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "MfbNajPexg3DmVle6ML8m",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 608.3332690470153,
      "y": 18053.405299459184,
      "width": 1389.4664306640625,
      "height": 291.66666666666674,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "2ujqAZmhHkqaSPsAR7hNq",
      "index": "b2rzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzzz",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1048874612,
      "version": 329,
      "versionNonce": 1098623732,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793114833867,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "We use eigen vector \nwhich on dot product changes the Scale Of the data points \nif we use eigen decomposition \nIt will map each data point with each PA to give us \nPA having hightest Varience ",
      "fontSize": 46.66666666666667,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "We use eigen vector \nwhich on dot product changes the Scale Of the data points \nif we use eigen decomposition \nIt will map each data point with each PA to give us \nPA having hightest Varience ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
